    {
      "source": "Configure encoders or writers for use with\n<a href=\"multipart/MultipartHttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.codec.multipart\"><code>MultipartHttpMessageWriter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置编码器或写入器，以便与 <a href=\"multipart/MultipartHttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.codec.multipart\"><code>MultipartHttpMessageWriter</code></a> 一起使用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that <a href=\"#maxInMemorySize(int)\"><code>maxInMemorySize(int)</code></a> and/or\n<a href=\"#enableLoggingRequestDetails(boolean)\"><code>enableLoggingRequestDetails(boolean)</code></a>, if configured, will be\napplied to the given reader, if applicable.",
      "translation": "请注意，如果已配置，<a href=\"#maxInMemorySize(int)\"><code>maxInMemorySize(int)</code></a> 和/或 <a href=\"#enableLoggingRequestDetails(boolean)\"><code>enableLoggingRequestDetails(boolean)</code></a> 将应用于给定的读取器（如适用）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default set to <code>false</code> so that request details are not shown.",
      "translation": "默认设置为<code>false</code>，因此不显示请求详情。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this is not set, in which case individual codec defaults\napply. All codecs are limited to 256K by default.",
      "translation": "默认情况下未设置此选项，此时将应用各个编解码器的默认值。默认情况下，所有编解码器均限制为 256K。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Register a consumer to apply to default config instances. This can be\nused to configure rather than replace a specific codec or multiple\ncodecs. The consumer is applied to every default <a href=\"../../core/codec/Encoder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.codec\"><code>Encoder</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../../core/codec/Decoder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.codec\"><code>Decoder</code></a>, <a href=\"HttpMessageReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageReader</code></a> and <a href=\"HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a>\ninstance.",
      "translation": "注册一个消费者以应用于默认配置实例。这可用于配置而非替换特定的编码器或多个编码器。该消费者将应用于每个默认的 <a href=\"../../core/codec/Encoder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.codec\"><code>Encoder</code></a>、<a href=\"../../core/codec/Decoder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.codec\"><code>Decoder</code></a>、<a href=\"HttpMessageReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageReader</code></a> 和 <a href=\"HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Customize or replace the HTTP message readers and writers registered by\ndefault. The options are further extended by\n<a href=\"ClientCodecConfigurer.ClientDefaultCodecs.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>ClientDefaultCodecs</code></a> and\n<a href=\"ServerCodecConfigurer.ServerDefaultCodecs.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>ServerDefaultCodecs</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自定义或替换默认注册的 HTTP 消息读取器和写入器。这些选项通过 <a href=\"ClientCodecConfigurer.ClientDefaultCodecs.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>ClientDefaultCodecs</code></a> 和 <a href=\"ServerCodecConfigurer.ServerDefaultCodecs.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>ServerDefaultCodecs</code></a> 进一步扩展。",
      "count": 2
    },
